    {
      "id": "claim_c7a3115517874389bb77596baad85498",
      "statement": "resolve_slack_thread_id resolves a Slack location by first checking an explicit stored mapping, then searching existing threads by source_context metadata for that location, and only falls back to the deterministic slack_thread_id (then binds it) when nothing matches; it raises when more than one thread matches a location.",
