      "statement": "create_durable_run attaches COMPLETION_WEBHOOK_URL only when RUN_COMPLETE_WEBHOOK_SECRET is set and the URL is a non-loopback absolute HTTP(S) URL, degrading to no webhook with a warning otherwise so a platform-rejected webhook cannot poison every runs.create.",
