      "id": "claim_59b0455eb65b4e12b4523824608c26e0",
      "statement": "create_durable_run sets stream_resumable=False and the Protocol v3 run shape (marker V3_STREAMING_CONFIG_KEY set, stream_mode list of values/updates/messages/custom/tasks/checkpoints, stream_subgraphs) so externally-triggered runs configure the correct streaming protocol; without the marker a run streams values only, so the dashboard sees no tools events or subagent namespaces.",
